= Directorate of Religious Affairs

The Directorate of Religious Affairs is Kemalism's response to the secular order: the subordination of religious institutions to state authorities. Through it, our republic regulates and oversees religious affairs. It therefore carries immense importance despite not being a ministry. Much remains to be done to make it serve our goals for a secular society.

- @sectarian_office: Found the Office of Sectarian Affairs
- @publications: Bring Religious Affairs Publications into Compliance with the Laws of the Republic
- @admit_women: Start admitting women to positions as preachers and professors of Islamic jurisprudence.
