= Bring Religious Affairs Publications into Compliance with the Laws of the Republic

As an official state institution, the Directorate of Religious Affairs cannot present rights granted to women under Republican law as illegitimate, immoral, or religiously invalid in its calendars, newspapers, books, or official sermons. Nor can it use its ties to İmam Hatip schools to promote such views among students. Such cases have nevertheless persisted for years. By reorganizing the Directorate, we will ensure that its publications no longer hinder our progress as a society.

- @root: Continue.

