= Start admitting women to positions as preachers and professors of Islamic jurisprudence.

Although it is not illegal, it is extremely difficult and practically unheard of for women to hold such positions in our academies or mosques. Many women may never even have considered the possibility. We will take an active stance, making these positions more accessible to women and encouraging wider participation.

- @root: Continue.

