= Increase the recruitment of women for positions as preachers and instructors of Islamic jurisprudence.

Our efforts to open religious positions to women have begun to bear fruit. Stopping now would leave the task half-finished. We must continue working toward equal employment in state-led religious affairs.

- @root: Continue.

